# adj midi map: Korg nanoKONTROL Studio driving the DJ Tools (vdj-ui)
#
# THE NUMBERS BELOW ARE A GUESS (nanoKONTROL2 style layout), not verified on the Studio.
# Capture the real ones with Controller... > Learn in the DJ Tools panel, or watch View > MIDI monitor
# and edit this file. Format: name  channel  controller  value
#   channel 0 = any, controller N = note on (value = note), value * = any value (knobs and faders).
# Buttons are momentary: the pressed value (127) acts, the release (0) is ignored.
# This file may also contain deck ops (start, stop, nudge_fwd ...): both programs read the same format.
#
#! source nanoKONTROL
#! pickup 1
#! rec_is_forward 1
#
# name           ch  ctrl  val

strip1_fader     0    0    *
strip2_fader     0    1    *
strip3_fader     0    2    *
strip4_fader     0    3    *
strip5_fader     0    4    *
strip6_fader     0    5    *
strip7_fader     0    6    *
strip8_fader     0    7    *
strip1_knob      0   16    *
strip2_knob      0   17    *
strip3_knob      0   18    *
strip4_knob      0   19    *
strip5_knob      0   20    *
strip6_knob      0   21    *
strip7_knob      0   22    *
strip8_knob      0   23    *

strip1_solo      0   32  127
strip2_solo      0   33  127
strip3_solo      0   34  127
strip4_solo      0   35  127
strip5_solo      0   36  127
strip6_solo      0   37  127
strip7_solo      0   38  127
strip8_solo      0   39  127

strip1_mute      0   48  127
strip2_mute      0   49  127
strip3_mute      0   50  127
strip4_mute      0   51  127
strip5_mute      0   52  127
strip6_mute      0   53  127
strip7_mute      0   54  127
strip8_mute      0   55  127

strip1_rec       0   64  127
strip2_rec       0   65  127
strip3_rec       0   66  127
strip4_rec       0   67  127
strip5_rec       0   68  127
strip6_rec       0   69  127
strip7_rec       0   70  127
strip8_rec       0   71  127

# select is not on the nanoKONTROL2 layout: learn it, then remove the #
#strip1_select    0    0  127
#strip2_select    0    0  127
#strip3_select    0    0  127
#strip4_select    0    0  127
#strip5_select    0    0  127
#strip6_select    0    0  127
#strip7_select    0    0  127
#strip8_select    0    0  127

track_back       0   58  127
track_fwd        0   59  127
#mode_toggle      0   60  127
